#: pages/platform/journalists.vue:53
msgid "@independent-journalists/modern-platform"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"We are creating a modern digital platform that is tailored to journalists "
"and publicists. \n"
"We offer readers an environment for uninterrupted reading, whether they use "
"a computer, a \n"
"mobile, a tablet, or an ebook in the future. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"We are lovers of good old paper newspapers and magazines. The design "
"platform combines the  \n"
"best of the era of printed periodicals and modern UX trends of today's "
"mobile and web applications. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"On the platform you can publish for free. As soon as the readers begin to "
"pay you, \n"
"we will charge 15% of the subscription price. \n"
"</p> \n"

#: pages/platform/journalists.vue:93
msgid "Start monetizing your content and become a truly independent author."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/journalists.vue:95
msgid "@independent-journalists/monetizing-content"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Advertising can't pay for quality content. Readers must learn to pay again "
"for quality content. \n"
" We must be clever about it. Join our unique system for paid content. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Readers can either subscribe directly to you or subscribe to newspapers from "
"editors who consider \n"
"your articles and tweets to be good and put them in their issues. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"If you are writing an particularly interesting content, readers have the "
"opportunity to send  \n"
"you extra money above the normal subscription. \n"
"</p> \n"

#: pages/platform/journalists.vue:170
msgid "Digital Publishing Platform for Journalists and Bloggers"
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/journalists.vue:175
msgid ""
"Kairly is a digital publishing platform for independent journalists and "
"bloggers who wants to start earning money for writing good content."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:7
msgid "Are you think-tank or NGO?"
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:10
msgid "Publish your ideas on a modern publishing platform."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:11
msgid "Reach new audiences for your cause."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:12
msgid "Get regular financial donations from your supporters."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:52
msgid "Publish your ideas on a modern platform and reach out to new audiences."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:54
msgid "@think-tanks/modern-platform"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Focus on communicating your ideas. We make sure that your content reaches "
"the people at its best, whether they're using a computer, cellphone, tablet "
"or electronic book reader.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Our platform is focused on creating a pleasant environment for readers where "
"they only read what they really care about and are not bothered by constant "
"notifications. <p> \n"
"We come up with a unique concept of digital newspapers. If a newspaper "
"editor finds your content interesting and well-crafted, it will include your "
"article to the issue of their newspaper. This allows you to reach new "
"audiences for your idea.</p> \n"

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:82
msgid "Get regular monetary contributions from your followers."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:84
msgid "@think-tanks/monetizing-content"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"We come up with a brand new concept of paid content on the Internet. It also "
"includes the possibility of regular payments from readers to organizations "
"like yours.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Readers can subscribe to your content for free. You may also require a "
"regular monthly subscription. Whether your content is free or not, readers "
"can voluntarily and regularly contribute extra money.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Your content may also appear in a variety of digital newspapers. Not only "
"will you reach new groups of people, you will also get a fair share from "
"newspaper subscription. That way you will earn extra money.</p> \n"

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:161
msgid "Digital Publishing Platform for Think-tanks & NGOs"
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:166
msgid ""
"Kairly is a digital publishing platform for think-tanks and NGOs that allow "
"them to receive voluntary donations."
msgstr ""

