#: pages/platform/publishers.vue:37
msgid "@publishers/why-newsletters"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"In the age of social media, it is hard to keep loyal readers. Regular "
"newsletters in a modern design are a way to build a loyal readers base.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"Our newsletters are inspired by paper typography with beautiful typography "
"and layout, and combine it with modern Internet formats such as tweets.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"Professional paid content is on the rise. Check out HBO Go, Spotify and "
"others. Well-prepared newsletters with interesting content are a way to "
"teach the reader to pay for content. The goal of our platform is to be "
"Netflix in the news industry.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"Paper newspapers and magazines are eternal. We try to get at least part of "
"their magic to all modern channels. We distribute newsletters to emails, RSS "
"readers, Kindle and other ebooks. We also have a modern desktop and mobile "
"application.\n"
"</p>"

